Implement the **Growth Analyst** as the intelligent layer of the existing Sponsorship Growth Platform.

This is the final major product module. It must connect the existing Overview, Campaigns, Sponsors & Contacts, Pipeline, Tasks, Collections and Analytics modules through a grounded, permission-aware conversational intelligence experience.

Extend the current application. Do not rebuild the shell, create a separate chatbot application or redesign existing modules.

